sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Cashier
  participant UI as Sales page
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  C->>UI: Tap or scan products
  UI->>UI: Check quantity is not above stock
  C->>UI: Choose payment, press Complete sale
  UI->>API: POST /api/sales (JWT)
  API->>DB: Begin transaction
  API->>DB: Save sale and sale items
  API->>DB: Reduce product stock
  API->>DB: Commit
  API-->>UI: Sale saved
  UI->>API: GET /api/products
  UI-->>C: Success message, new stock, low-stock alerts
